{"id": "416289", "name": "אורך גרף של פונקציה המוגדרת כאינטגרל ∫√(t³−1)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div><p>נתונה הפונקציה</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ f(x)=\\int_{1}^{x}\\sqrt{t^3-1}\\,dt,\\qquad x\\ge 1 \\]</p><p>חשבו את אורך הגרף של הפונקציה מעל הקטע <span dir=\"ltr\">\\([{{CT:0}},{{CT:1}}]\\)</span>.</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>רשמו את הערך המדויק (לא קירוב עשרוני).</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(L\\) = [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">מבנה הפתרון:</b> את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(f'(x)\\)</span> מוצאים לפי המשפט היסודי, ואז <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(1+f'(x)^2\\)</span> הוא ריבוע שלם.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 1 — הנגזרת</b><br>לפי המשפט היסודי של החשבון האינטגרלי <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(f'(x)=\\sqrt{x^3-1}\\)</span>, ולכן<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\sqrt{1+f'(x)^2}=\\sqrt{1+x^3-1}=\\sqrt{x^3}=x^{3/2}\\qquad(x\\ge1) \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 2 — אורך הגרף</b><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ L=\\int_{ {{CT:0}} }^{ {{CT:1}} }x^{3/2}\\,dx=\\frac{2}{5}\\Big[x^{5/2}\\Big]_{ {{CT:0}} }^{ {{CT:1}} }=\\frac{2}{5}\\left({{CT:2}}-{{CT:3}}\\right)={{CT:4}} \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]]", "prtcorrect": "<p>Correct answer, well done.</p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p>Your answer is partially correct.</p>", "prtincorrect": "<p>Incorrect answer.</p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "tans1", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "5*(b^(5/2)-a^(5/2))/2", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-2-T", "feedback": "<p>הפונקציה הקדומה של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x^{3/2}\\)</span> היא <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\frac{2}{5}x^{5/2}\\)</span>: מחלקים במעריך החדש, לא כופלים בו.</p>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-2-F", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["a", "b", "tans1"], "nvariants": 24}